First version of Button and AsideBar components. AsideBar based on its Figma design, but has some extra styles on interactions (especially buttons).
Button component has three states, depending on icons it gets:
- leading button (with leading-icon prop);
- trailing button (with trailing-icon prop);
- standalone button (without any icons);
Except states, button component has three styles:
- default (~primary)
- inverted (~secondary, color invertion of default)
- transparent(~average button, without any border and background)

